Source: effectcraft
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <quietcraft@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), binutils, xz-utils, zstd, desktop-file-utils
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/storytold/effectcraft

Package: effectcraft
Architecture: amd64
# Runtime set: upstream's own DEB Depends verified correct as-is
# (libc6/libgcc-s1/libxkbcommon0 + vulkan-or-EGL loaders); t64-era names
# need no adjustment for this set on Debian Testing.
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, libasound2t64, libc6 (>= 2.35), libegl1, libgcc-s1, libvulkan1, libxkbcommon0
Description: Motion graphics/VFX - clean-room After Effects in pure Rust
 EffectCraft: motion graphics and visual effects.
 A clean-room Adobe After Effects reimplementation in pure Rust.
